{%- comment -%}
  Malbor wordmark, inlined from the React prototype so the landing page does
  not depend on a raster logo asset.

  Accepts an optional `url`. With one it renders as a link to the brand site
  and the wordmark supplies the link's accessible name; without one it stays a
  plain span.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if url != blank -%}
  <a class="lp-logo lp-logo--link" href="{{ url }}">
{%- else -%}
  <span class="lp-logo">
{%- endif -%}
